---
import { ShieldCheck, TrendingUp } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="about" class="relative bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-16 px-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h2
        class="mb-6 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl"
      >
        Redefining Financial <br />
        <span class="text-brand-teal italic">Leadership</span> for the Modern Era
      </h2>
      <div class="bg-brand-teal mb-8 h-1 w-20"></div>
      <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        At Numiq, we believe that true financial success lies in the details.
        Established to serve the evolving, complex needs of Indian and global
        enterprises, we provide a comprehensive suite of financial services
        characterized by unyielding integrity, continuous innovation, and
        strategic intelligence.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Our team comprises seasoned chartered accountants, financial analysts,
        and strategy consultants dedicated to simplifying complex financial
        landscapes. We don't just report on the past; we analyze it to
        illuminate the future.
      </p>

      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-2">
            <ShieldCheck class="text-brand-teal h-5 w-5" />
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-700 uppercase"
            >Unyielding Integrity</span
          >
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-2">
            <TrendingUp class="text-brand-teal h-5 w-5" />
          </div>
          <span
            class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-700 uppercase"
            >Continuous Innovation</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="border-brand-teal/20 absolute -inset-4 z-0 rounded-sm border">
      </div>
      <div
        class="group relative z-10 h-[500px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-slate-100 shadow-2xl before:absolute before:inset-0 before:z-10 before:bg-linear-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-transparent before:to-black"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1932&q=80"
          alt="Meeting"
          class="z-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-90 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
        <!-- Kept dark linear at bottom for text legibility -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 z-20 w-full p-8">
          <p class="text-brand-teal font-serif text-xl italic brightness-125">
            "Scale in every action."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
